  "description": "Zero-dependency attributes and resolver for decorating DTOs with formatting, layout, validation and import metadata. Consumers (web grids, Cayaqui.MPS.Reports, Cayaqui.MPS.ExcelImport) read the same attributes to render and parse consistently. Includes EVM/EPC domain attributes (Wbs, Cbs, Schedule, EvmIndicator, EvmBand, Money). Proprietary — requires a commercial agreement with Cayaqui.",
